      "text": "$3: 4$",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, $\\quad v_{1}=\\frac{(2 n-1)}{4 l_{1}} v$\r\n$$\r\nv_{2}=\\frac{n}{2 l_{2}} v\r\n$$\r\nHence, $y_{1}=v_{2}$\r\n$$\r\n\\frac{l_{1}}{l_{2}}=\\frac{3}{4}\r\n$$"
  }
